Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.39,0:22:40.06,Ending1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\pos(-2040,-1965)\shad3000\blur6\be15\fscx94.5\fsp0.375\xbord9\ybord3.6\4a&H0A&\4c&HFFE5E1&\fad(140,320)}Não sei como proteger ninguém,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.06,0:22:45.86,Ending1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\pos(-2040,-1965)\shad3000\blur6\be15\fscx94.5\fsp0.375\xbord9\ybord3.6\4a&H0A&\4c&HE2E2E2&\fad(140,320)}e meus ideais podem ser em vão,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.07,0:22:55.07,Ending1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\pos(-2040,-1965)\shad3000\blur6\be15\fscx94.5\fsp0.375\xbord9\ybord3.6\4a&H10&\4c&H062133&\fad(140,320)}mas eu quero viver a minha vida
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.07,0:23:00.08,Ending1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\pos(-2040,-1965)\shad3000\blur6\be15\fscx94.5\fsp0.375\xbord9\ybord3.6\4a&H10&\4c&HE6C2CB&\fad(0,320)}O passado se repete diante dos meus olhos
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.08,0:23:07.88,Ending1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\pos(-2040,-1965)\shad3000\blur6\be15\fscx94.5\fsp0.375\xbord9\ybord3.6\4a&H10&\4c&HE6C2CB&\fad(140,320)}Aqui confiarei em quem sou agora ao seu lado
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.88,0:23:13.97,Ending1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\pos(-2040,-1965)\shad3000\blur6\be15\fscx94.5\fsp0.375\xbord9\ybord3.6\4a&H10&\4c&HE6C2CB&\fad(140,320)}Até que o meu sonho desmorone e murche,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.97,0:23:19.60,Ending1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\pos(-2040,-1965)\shad3000\blur6\be15\fscx94.5\fsp0.375\xbord9\ybord3.6\4a&H10&\4c&HE6C2CB&\fad(140,320)}espero que construa o paraíso comigo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.60,0:23:23.31,Ending1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\pos(-2040,-1965)\shad3000\blur6\be15\fscx94.5\fsp0.375\xbord9\ybord3.6\4a&H10&\4c&HE6C2CB&\fad(140,720)}Lute contra o seu destino
