Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.07,0:22:55.07,Ending1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1035)\blur0.75\c&HD1E5FA&\1a&H10&\fad(140,320)}mas eu quero viver a minha vida
Dialogue: 1,0:22:55.07,0:23:00.08,Ending1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1035)\blur0.75\1a&H10&\c&H4C038B&\fad(0,320)}O passado se repete diante dos meus olhos
