Dialogue: 1,0:23:07.88,0:23:13.97,Ending1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1035)\blur0.75\1a&H10&\c&H4C038B&\fad(140,320)}Até que o meu sonho desmorone e murche,
