Dialogue: 1,0:23:19.60,0:23:23.31,Ending1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1035)\blur0.75\1a&H10&\c&H4C038B&\fad(140,320)}Lute contra o seu destino
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.18,0:01:09.22,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Diante do desespero absoluto
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.52,0:01:13.22,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Que quase consumiu os nossos corações
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.72,0:01:19.77,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Você ainda encontrou a coragem para sorrir
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.02,0:01:24.57,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Como se aceitasse tudo aquilo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:27.83,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Eu perdi a minha voz
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.03,0:01:30.45,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}E as palavras que queria dizer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.73,0:01:35.70,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Mas a cada vez que caía de joelhos
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.05,0:01:40.00,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Eu me levantava e continuava a caminhar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.27,0:01:45.67,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Estávamos buscando o futuro branco ideal
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.88,0:01:50.90,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}A nossa única esperança
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.23,0:01:53.39,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Agora posso ter ficado sem nada
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.56,0:01:58.81,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,0)\blur7.5}A não ser estas emoções ardentes que
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.87,0:02:01.91,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,380)\blur7.5}Não têm para onde ir
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.16,0:02:07.16,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Ainda assim, buscarei um novo amanhecer
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.54,0:02:10.57,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Com mais de uma resposta certa
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.81,0:02:14.40,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,0)\blur7.5}Não vou parar
